+/// A streamed sound (`stream: true`: music, records), decoded only a little
+/// ahead of the mixer: vanilla's `Channel.attachBufferStream` queues
+/// `QUEUED_BUFFER_COUNT` buffers of `BUFFER_DURATION_SECONDS` each and refills
